  "description": "<p>This personalized Christian welcome mat offers a faith-filled design, perfect for creating a warm and spiritually enriching entryway. It features uplifting messages and can be customized with text, making it a unique addition to any home. Designed for both indoor and outdoor use, this doormat helps maintain clean floors while adding a personal touch.</p><h3>Product Highlights</h3><ul>\n<li>Features Christian-themed designs and uplifting messages.</li>\n<li>Allows for customization with desired text.</li>\n<li>Provides a soft touch under bare feet.</li>\n<li>Equipped with a non-slip backing for stability.</li>\n<li>Suitable for various indoor and outdoor settings.</li>\n<li>Designed to dry wet feet and capture dirt effectively.</li>\n</ul><h3>Specifications</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Attribute</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Value</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Rug Form</td>\n<td>Doormat</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Item Shape</td>\n<td>Rectangular</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Weave Type</td>\n<td>Sponge - Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pile Height</td>\n<td>Low Pile</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Construction Type</td>\n<td>Machine Made</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Indoor/Outdoor Usage</td>\n<td>Both</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Room Type</td>\n<td>Multiple</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Water Resistance</td>\n<td>Water Resistant</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Special Features</td>\n<td>Washable</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Pattern</td>\n<td>Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Theme</td>\n<td>customized prayer mat with name</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Style</td>\n<td>Christian, Jesus, Bible</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Number of Pieces</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Material &amp; Care</h3><table border=\"1\" cellpadding=\"6\" style=\"border-collapse:collapse;width:100%\">\n<tr>\n<th align=\"left\" width=\"35%\">Item</th>\n<th align=\"left\">Detail</th>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Material Type</td>\n<td>Memory Foam</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Backing Material</td>\n<td>Rubber</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Care Instructions</td>\n<td>Machine Wash</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cleaning Method</td>\n<td>Hose or sponge clean with water and mild liquid soap</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Drying</td>\n<td>Air dry</td>\n</tr>\n</table><h3>Where It Works</h3><p>This versatile doormat is suitable for placement in various locations, including bedrooms, bathrooms, and living rooms. It is also ideal for use at the front door, enhancing both indoor and outdoor entryways with a welcoming and blessed atmosphere.</p>",
